        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner, the case concerns whether Congress intended judicial review of motions to reopen asylum decisions under \u00a71252(b)(6)."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "8444d33056dc66d0498cd44e3f1122a57e51cea1876645cfc6eb8c73a8eadfee",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-8444d33056dc-0000-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Petitioner argues that Congress limited reduction of judicial review to authority specified in subchapter\u202f2 of chapter\u202f12 of Title\u202f8 and did not intend to remove courts\u2019 jurisdiction over other discretionary decisions."
      }
